  "description": "Ultra9 is our latest offering where we take a Dream8 (or a Dream24) and customize it by adding a Box 3/Prime 9 derailleur, shifter, and 11-50 rear cassette. This provides an extremely wide range of gearing (similar to a 24 speed but not quite as low) and simplifies shifting by retaining the single up front. Same comfort, safety features, and ergonomics as our popular Dream8 because it IS a Dream8 - just upgraded.\nUltra9-D\nIdentical to the Ultra9 except with disc brakes. Depending on the size and color, we may upgrade a Dream24.\n\nUltra9-HD\nIdentical to the Ultra9-D except we add heavy duty wheels, a double wall/dual bolt seat post, and seat struts to give it a 400-pound weight capacity.",
